How many Canberra children live within a five-minute walk of a playground?
The ACT Government's 537 public playgrounds, Canberra's mesh blocks with their children aged 0 to 14 (2021 Census), and
a five-minute walk along OpenStreetMap's paths from every playground, set beside a 400 m circle round each.
